    "intro_html":  "Juicy cajun-crusted pork chops over dirty rice loaded with chorizo, peppers, and green onion. The chorizo stands in for the traditional chicken livers and nobody files a complaint. Every bowl brings \u003cstrong\u003e44 grams of protein\u003c/strong\u003e for about \u003cstrong\u003e$4.02\u003c/strong\u003e (at everyday cost) of honest Louisiana-style cooking.",
